  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution PNG illustrations featuring cozy watercolor holiday woodland animals, gingerbread houses, pine wreaths, lanterns, and festive gifts.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom mugs, tumblers, coasters, and holiday homeware blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical holiday items.   Custom apparel creation for holiday t-shirts, festive hoodies, winter aprons, and seasonal tote bags.   Christmas, winter, holiday, and seasonal celebration-themed wall art, greeting cards, party invitations, and custom stickers.",
